    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Entry
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'The cold. At first, there was only that.

        A harsh white light, filtered
        through a wall covered in condensation.

        Something was beating.

        Slowly...
        Your heart.'
      - "Le froid. D'abord, il n'y eut que cela.\nUne lumi\xE8re blanche, brutale,
        filtr\xE9e par une paroi couverte de condensation.\nQuelque chose battait.\nLentement...
        Ton c\u0153ur."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Second
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Finally.
      - Enfin.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Third
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'The liquid drains around you.

        Your feet touch the floor. Your legs
        almost immediately give way.

        You breathe in.

        Once. Twice.

        The
        air burns.'
      - "Le liquide descend autour de toi.\nTes pieds touchent le sol. Tes jambes
        c\xE8dent presque imm\xE9diatement.\nTu inspires.\nUne fois. Deux fois.\nL'air
        br\xFBle."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Fourth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Don''t force it.

        Your body knows how to breathe.

        Even
        if you don''t remember how yet.'
      - "Ne force pas.\nTon corps sait comment respirer.\nM\xEAme si toi, tu ne t'en
        souviens pas encore."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Fifth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '...

        Where am I?'
      - "...\nO\xF9 suis-je ?"
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Sixth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Stand up.
      - Debout.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Seventh
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Who are you?
      - "Qui \xEAtes-vous ?"
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Eight
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Stand up.

        We don''t have time for the rest.'
      - 'Debout.

        Nous n''avons pas le temps pour le reste.'
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Ninth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'The wall of the tank opens.

        Before you lies a room you don''t recognize.

        And
        yet... something about this place feels familiar.

        Not a memory.
        The trace of one. A distant echo.'
      - "La paroi de la cuve s'ouvre.\nDevant toi s'\xE9tend une pi\xE8ce que tu
        ne reconnais pas.\nPourtant... quelque chose dans cet endroit te semble familier.\nPas
        un souvenir. La trace d'un souvenir. Un \xE9cho lointain."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Tenth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I don't remember anything.
      - Je ne me souviens de rien.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Eleventh
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I know.
      - Je sais.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Twelveth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Nothing.

        Not even my name.'
      - "De rien.\nM\xEAme pas de mon nom."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Thirteenth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I know that too.
      - "\xC7a aussi, je le sais."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Fourteenth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'A metallic sound echoes from behind the door.

        Something is coming.'
      - "Un bruit m\xE9tallique r\xE9sonne derri\xE8re la porte.\nQuelque chose approche."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Fifteenth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Listen to me carefully.

        You''ll get your answers.

        But
        to get them...

        you need to survive first.'
      - "\xC9coute-moi attentivement.\nTu auras tes r\xE9ponses.\nMais pour les obtenir...\ntu
        dois d'abord survivre."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Sixteenth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Survive what?
      - "Survivre \xE0 quoi ?"
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Seventeenth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'HOSTILE DETECTED.

        COMBAT SEQUENCE READY.'
      - 'HOSTILE DETECTED.

        COMBAT SEQUENCE READY.'
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/Level 1 Eighteenth
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - That.
      - "\xC0 \xE7a."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_001
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Silence returns. The figure in front of you collapses.

        For a moment,
        nothing moves. Then you see its face.'
      - 'Le silence revient. La silhouette devant toi s''effondre.

        Pendant
        un instant, plus rien ne bouge. Puis tu vois son visage.'
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_002
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ...
      - ...
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_003
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Your face. The same features.

        The same body.

        Even the
        same scars.'
      - "Ton visage. Les m\xEAmes traits.\nLe m\xEAme corps.\nJusqu'aux m\xEAmes
        cicatrices."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_004
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - What the hell...
      - C'est quoi ce bordel...
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_005
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Keep moving.
      - Continue d'avancer.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_006
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - That was me.
      - "C'\xE9tait moi."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_007
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - No.
      - Non.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_008
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I know what I saw.
      - Je sais ce que j'ai vu.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_009
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'You saw something that looked like you.

        There''s a difference.'
      - "Tu as vu quelque chose qui te ressemblait.\nIl y a une diff\xE9rence."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_010
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Then what was it?
      - "Alors qu'est-ce que c'\xE9tait ?"
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_011
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Not now. '
      - Pas maintenant.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_012
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You keep saying that.
      - "Tu n'arr\xEAtes pas de dire \xE7a."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_013
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - We haven't enought time. So, for now, keep listening.
      - "Nous n'avons pas le temps. Alors pour l'instant, continue de m'\xE9couter."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_014
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'You look back at the body. Something about it bothers you.

        Not
        its face. Not anymore.

        The way it fought. For a few brief moments...
        you knew what it was going to do.'
      - "Tu regardes de nouveau le corps. Quelque chose te d\xE9range.\nPas son visage.
        Plus maintenant.\nSa fa\xE7on de combattre. Pendant quelques courts instants...
        tu savais ce qu'il allait faire."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_015
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I knew its movements.
      - Je connaissais ses mouvements.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_016
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Good.
      - Bien.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_017
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Why?
      - Pourquoi ?
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue/L01E_018
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Keep going. You'll remember.
      - Continue. Tu t'en souviendras.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_001
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Another room. Another figure waiting in the dark.

        Then it steps
        into the light.'
      - "Une autre pi\xE8ce. Une autre silhouette attend dans l'obscurit\xE9.\nPuis
        elle avance dans la lumi\xE8re."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_002
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You've got to be kidding me.
      - C'est pas vrai...
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_003
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'The same face. Again.

        But something is different. Its posture.

        The
        way it watches you. This one feels... more aware.'
      - "Le m\xEAme visage. Encore.\nMais quelque chose est diff\xE9rent. Sa posture.\nLa
        fa\xE7on dont il t'observe. Celui-ci semble... plus conscient."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_004
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Another one.
      - Encore un.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_005
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Yes.
      - Oui.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_006
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - And you're still not going to tell me what they are.
      - Et tu ne vas toujours pas me dire ce qu'ils sont.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_007
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Would the answer help you survive?
      - "Est-ce que la r\xE9ponse t'aiderait \xE0 survivre ?"
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_008
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - It might help me understand why I keep killing myself.
      - "\xC7a m'aiderait peut-\xEAtre \xE0 comprendre pourquoi je continue de me
        tuer moi-m\xEAme."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_009
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You are not killing yourself.
      - "Tu ne te tues pas toi-m\xEAme."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_010
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You know what I mean.
      - Tu sais ce que je veux dire.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02_011
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Then survive. Ask again afterward.
      - "Alors survis. Repose-moi la question apr\xE8s."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_001
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "The second one falls. \nThis time, you don't look away.\nIts body begins
        to fade just like the first."
      - "Le deuxi\xE8me s'effondre.\nCette fois, tu ne d\xE9tournes pas le regard.\nSon
        corps commence \xE0 dispara\xEEtre, exactement comme le premier."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_002
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You said it wasn't me.
      - "Tu as dit que ce n'\xE9tait pas moi."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_003
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - It wasn't.
      - "\xC7a ne l'\xE9tait pas."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_004
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Then why does it have my body?
      - Alors pourquoi est-ce qu'il a mon corps ?
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_005
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Because some things are easier to rebuild than others.
      - "Parce que certaines choses sont plus faciles \xE0 reconstruire que d'autres."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_006
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Rebuild?
      - Reconstruire ?
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_007
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Keep moving.
      - Continue d'avancer.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_008
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'No. You said I could ask again afterward.

        I''m asking.'
      - "Non. Tu as dit que je pourrais reposer la question apr\xE8s.\nAlors je la
        pose."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_009
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ...
      - ...
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_010
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - How many of them are there?
      - Combien est-ce qu'il y en a ?
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_011
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - More than one.
      - Plus d'un.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_012
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I noticed.
      - Sans blague.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_013
