    - Term: Dialogue Level 2/L02E_014
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'The last traces of the body disappear.

        For a moment, you can still
        see its face.

        Your face. Then nothing remains.'
      - "Les derni\xE8res traces du corps disparaissent.\nPendant un instant, tu
        peux encore distinguer son visage.\nTon visage. Puis il ne reste plus rien."
