    - Term: Dialogue Level 4/L04_005
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "A figure stands at the other end of the room. \nMotionless. Waiting. You
        already know its face. \nBut this one doesn't attack. Not yet."
      - "Une silhouette se tient \xE0 l'autre bout de la pi\xE8ce.\nImmobile. Elle
        attend. Tu connais d\xE9j\xE0 son visage. \nMais celle-ci n'attaque pas.
        Pas encore."
