    - Term: Dialogue Level 4/L04_013
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'The figure slowly raises its head.

        For a second, there is something
        in its eyes.

        Not rage. Not hunger. Recognition.'
      - "La silhouette rel\xE8ve lentement la t\xEAte.\nPendant une seconde, il y
        a quelque chose dans son regard.\nPas de la rage. Pas de la faim. De la reconnaissance."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
