    - Term: Dialogue Level 4/L04E_003
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Its body trembles.

        One hand presses against the ground, as if it
        were trying to stand again.

        It fails. Then it looks at you. Really
        looks at you.'
      - "Son corps tremble.\nUne main s'appuie contre le sol, comme s'il essayait
        de se relever.\nIl \xE9choue. Puis il te regarde. Il te regarde vraiment."
