    - Term: Dialogue Level 4/L04E_029
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'It has forgotten almost everything.

        Pain tends to remain longer.

        But
        perhaps its anger isn''t entirely misplaced.'
      - "Il a presque tout oubli\xE9.\nLa douleur, elle, reste plus longtemps.\nMais
        peut-\xEAtre que sa col\xE8re n'est pas totalement injustifi\xE9e."
