    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05_001
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Another figure stands ahead.

        At first glance, it looks like the
        others.

        Then it moves. Slower.

        More deliberate. Every motion
        feels controlled.'
      - "Une autre silhouette se tient devant toi.\nAu premier regard, elle ressemble
        aux autres.\nPuis elle bouge. Plus lentement.\nPlus d\xE9lib\xE9r\xE9ment.
        Chaque mouvement semble ma\xEEtris\xE9."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05_002
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Be careful.

        This one survived longer than the others.'
      - "Sois prudent.\nCelui-ci a surv\xE9cu plus longtemps que les autres."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05_003
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - How much longer?
      - Beaucoup plus longtemps ?
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05_004
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Long enough.

        Don''t underestimate it.'
      - 'Assez.

        Ne le sous-estime pas.'
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_001
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'The final blow lands. The creature staggers.

        But it doesn''t fall.
        Not yet.

        For a moment, it simply stands there... looking at you.'
      - "Le dernier coup porte. La cr\xE9ature vacille.\nMais elle ne tombe pas.
        Pas encore.\nPendant un instant, elle reste simplement l\xE0... \xE0 te regarder."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_002
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Thank you.
      - Merci.
