      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'They came back. Again and again.

        But each time, something was missing

        A
        memory. A name. A piece of what they were.'
      - "Ils revenaient. Encore et encore.\nMais \xE0 chaque fois, quelque chose
        manquait.\nUn souvenir. Un nom. Une partie de ce qu'ils \xE9taient."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_011
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Until they became this.
      - "Jusqu'\xE0 devenir \xE7a."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_012
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Yes.
      - Oui.
      - 
      - 
