    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_017
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Then tell me who you are.

        No more avoiding the question.'
      - "Alors dis-moi qui tu es.\nPlus question d'\xE9viter la r\xE9ponse."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_018
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You already know part of the answer.
      - "Tu connais d\xE9j\xE0 une partie de la r\xE9ponse."
