      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_022
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'This world was attacked.

        Its cities. Its people. Its life.

        Almost
        everything was destroyed.'
      - "Ce monde a \xE9t\xE9 attaqu\xE9.\nSes villes. Ses habitants. Sa vie.\nPresque
        tout a \xE9t\xE9 d\xE9truit."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_023
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - How do you know?
      - Comment tu le sais ?
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_024
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Because I felt it.
      - Parce que je l'ai ressenti.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
