    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_026
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Every wound. Every death.

        Every place that went silent.'
      - 'Chaque blessure. Chaque mort.

        Chaque endroit devenu silencieux.'
