    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_040
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Sunlight. Real sunlight. Warm against your skin.

        Voices somewhere
        behind you.

        Laughter. Buildings stretching toward a blue sky.

        For
        a moment...you know this place.'
      - "La lumi\xE8re du soleil. La vraie. Chaude contre ta peau.\nDes voix quelque
        part derri\xE8re toi.\nDes rires. Des b\xE2timents s'\xE9l\xE8vent sous un
        ciel bleu.\nPendant un instant... tu connais cet endroit."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_041
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Hey. You're going to be late.
      - "H\xE9. Tu vas \xEAtre en retard."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_042
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
