      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Are you listening to me?
      - "Tu m'\xE9coutes ?"
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_044
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "You turn toward the voice.\nA face. Familiar. Important.\nYou almost remember\u2014"
      - "Tu te retournes vers la voix.\nUn visage. Familier. Important.\nTu es presque
        sur le point de te souvenir\u2014"
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_045
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Then it''s gone.

        Cold walls. Cold air. Silence.'
      - "Puis tout dispara\xEEt.\nLes murs froids. L'air froid. Le silence."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue Level 5/L05E_046
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
