    - Term: Tutorial/Start
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Welcome to the Ghost Tactics tutorial. Click the pulsing buttons to complete
        the tutorial. You can also skip each tutorial individually, or disable tutorials
        entirely in the settings.
      - "Bienvenue dans le tutoriel de Ghost Tactics. Clique sur les boutons qui
        pulsent pour terminer le tutoriel. Tu peux aussi passer chaque tutoriel ou
        d\xE9sactiver les tutoriels dans les options."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Tutorial/Second Step
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You can change your selection at any time before the fight starts.
      - "Tu peux annuler ton choix \xE0 tout moment tant que le combat n'est pas
        lanc\xE9."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Tutorial/Fifth Step
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You can clear the selected actions by clicking this button.
      - Tu peux vider la liste des actions choisies en cliquant sur ce bouton.
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Tutorial/Ghost Step Change Selection
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - When you die, you can choose one of the skills you used during the previous
        fight. You can change your choice at any time. But for now, let's stick with
        Dodge.
      - "Lorsque tu meurs, tu peux choisir l'une des comp\xE9tences que tu as utilis\xE9es
        lors du combat pr\xE9c\xE9dent. Tu peux changer ton choix \xE0 tout moment.
        Mais pour l'instant, restons sur l'Esquive."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Tutorial/Ghost Step Choice Confirm
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - For now, only Dodge can be used. The other actions will be implemented later.
      - "Pour l'instant, seule l'esquive peut \xEAtre utilis\xE9e. Les autres actions
        seront impl\xE9ment\xE9es plus tard."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Tutorial/Ghost Step Selection
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Here, you can see which actions you've kept.
      - "Ici, tu peux voir quelles actions tu as conserv\xE9es."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Tutorial/Ghost Step Action
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - When this button appears, you can use one of the actions you've kept.
      - "Quand ce bouton appara\xEEt, cela signifie que tu peux utiliser une des
        actions que tu as conserv\xE9es."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Tutorial/Previsualized
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Currently disabled, this button will allow you to preview some of your opponent's
        actions.
      - "D\xE9sactiv\xE9 pour l'instant, ce bouton te permettra de pr\xE9visualiser
        une partie des actions de ton adversaire."
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Tutorial/Confirm Tutorial
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - This game is still in development. Try different combinations and take the
        time to read the dialogues. That's where you'll learn more about the world
        you're in. Have fun!
      - "Ce jeu est toujours en d\xE9veloppement. Teste plusieurs combinaisons et
        prends le temps de lire les dialogues. C'est l\xE0 que tu comprendras l'univers
        dans lequel tu te trouves. Bon jeu \xE0 toi !"
      - 
      - 
      Flags: 00000000
      Languages_Touch: []
